# Known vulnerabilities that scripts/vulncheck.sh tolerates.
#
# The scan fails on every finding that is not listed here, and it also fails
# when an entry here is no longer reported (so stale exceptions get removed).
# Each entry needs a reason and a condition for removing it.
#
# Format: <ID> <date reviewed> <reason>
#
# There are currently no accepted exceptions: every reported vulnerability is
# fixed by an upstream release the project has taken. If a new finding appears
# with no released fix, add it here with a justification and a removal
# condition, as the git history of this file shows was done for GO-2026-6443
# (grpc-go panic), which was superseded and removed on 2026-10-10 once the
# vulnerability database stopped reporting it.
